license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/temuulenkh/lexicalization"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a large-scale quantitative analysis of factors
  that predict lexicalization across languages, testing the hypothesis that
  usage frequency predicts lexicalization.
keywords:
  - lexicalization
  - usage frequency
  - usage-lexicalization hypothesis
  - linguistic typology
  - cross-linguistic corpus analysis
